          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Rising long-term yields increase global discount rates and tend to strengthen the dollar, which raises the real cost of dollar‑priced energy for many buyers and dampens demand, exerting downward pressure on energy price levels over ensuing months." />
