          <attvalue for="35" value="0.75" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="An abrupt drop in energy supply flows triggers sharp repricing in commodity and derivatives markets that forces deleveraging and margin calls in intermediary balance sheets, spilling over into fixed‑income liquidity and causing larger and more frequent bond price and yield swings." />
