          <attvalue for="35" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A rapid decline in delivered fuel volumes to the conflict theater reduces available fuel for armored, ground and air platforms, constraining operational tempos and lowering the frequency and scale of kinetic strikes." />
