          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A sustained decline in refined fuel inventories raises perceived structural supply risk and inflation/rollover risk for energy‑importing sovereigns, increasing the term premium investors demand and thereby lifting long‑term sovereign yields." />
