          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Declining refined fuel inventories constrain backup power and on‑site energy flexibility for dispersed data centers and fabs, pushing workloads and new deployments toward large, centralized providers and locations with secure fuel/electricity supplies." />
