          <attvalue for="35" value="0.85" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Rapid escalation in energy-related sanctions constrains Iran's economic outlets and signals coercion, prompting Iranian leadership to authorize or accelerate asymmetric retaliatory attacks and proxy operations that feed a tit‑for‑tat escalation dynamic." />
